#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Overconfidence Bias]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- 🧠 Overestimating one's own abilities]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- 💸 Leads to excessive risk-taking in financial decisions]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("Overconfidence bias is a cognitive bias where individuals overestimate their own abilities, knowledge, or chances of success.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("In the context of financial decision-making, this bias can lead to excessive risk-taking, as overconfident individuals may believe they can outperform the market or make better decisions than others.")
]
]

#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Examples]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- 📈 Overtrading due to perceived ability to time the market]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- 🎲 Underestimating risks in investment decisions]
#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[- 🙅‍♂️ Neglecting to diversify portfolio]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("For example, an overconfident investor might overtrade, believing they can consistently time the market and make profitable trades, despite evidence suggesting that timing the market is difficult.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("They may also underestimate the risks associated with their investments, thinking they have a higher tolerance for risk than they actually do.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Additionally, overconfident investors may neglect to properly diversify their portfolios, as they believe they can pick winning investments without the need for diversification.")
]
]

#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Consequences]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- 📉 Potential for significant financial losses]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- 😓 Increased stress and anxiety]
#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[- 🏦 Negative impact on long-term financial goals]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("The consequences of overconfidence bias in financial decision-making can be severe. Overconfident investors may be more likely to experience significant financial losses due to their excessive risk-taking.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("This can lead to increased stress and anxiety, as the reality of their financial situation may not align with their overconfident expectations.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("In the long run, overconfidence bias can have a negative impact on an individual's ability to achieve their financial goals, such as saving for retirement or building wealth.")
]
]

#slide()[
